 ['After a successful generation, issue daemon stop and retain its exit code and final stopped response. Start again and verify the committed generation survives.', 'On Windows, also run the GUI test. Close the window, reopen it, and choose Exit tray: the daemon must remain reachable. Stop and exit must name and stop only its selected daemon.', 'For a stop-timeout fixture, retain the timeout and inspect subsequent process/job state. Do not interpret timeout as cancellation or silently kill a process.'],
